sound L4L.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I missed school again today.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's fine. Take as much time off as you need until you get better.
sound L4M.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Did you have fun at school?
text @[Tomoya]
text Not one bit.
sound L4N.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Why not?
text @[Tomoya]
text Because you weren't there.
sound L4O.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm sorry...
sound L4P.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I'm happy to hear you tell me that.
text @[Tomoya]
text I was waiting for so long.
sound L4Q.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text For what?
text @[Tomoya]
text First we played basketball...
text @[Tomoya]
text And then we worked on the play for Founder's Festival...
sound L4R.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes?
text @[Tomoya]
text So I had thought that we could finally spend time together at school like a real dating couple.
text @[Tomoya]
text I was waiting to be able to live that kind of life.
sound L4S.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm sorry...
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't you think that sort of thing is the best part of being a student?
sound L4T.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I do.
text @[Tomoya]
text Do you really, though?
sound L4U.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text What? Why do you say that?
text @[Tomoya]
text Because you don't seem to be thinking about that sort of thing at all.
sound L4V.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I-Is that so...?
text @[Tomoya]
text You're such a kid.
sound L4W.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That isn't true.
sound L4X.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm older than you, Tomoya-kun.
text @[Tomoya]
text Age doesn't have anything to do with it.
sound L4Y.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I do want to do that kind of thing too.
sound L4Z.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I want to do that kind of thing with you. Not just at school, in all sorts of places.
text @[Tomoya]
text What exactly do you mean by "that kind of thing"...?
sound L50.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text @Well...
delay 119
text Walking side-by-side... and talking.
text @[Tomoya]
text I want to say we always do that.
sound L51.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Oh, that may be true... Then...
sound L52.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Walk while holding hands.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Okay.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then get well soon so we can do that.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll be waiting for that day.
sound L53.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay, I understand.
