sound L54.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun...
text @[Tomoya]
text What is it, Nagisa?
sound L55.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text It's summer vacation.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's right, it is.
sound L56.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You don't need to bother with me. Go out and have fun.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's fine. Let me stay here.
sound L57.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You'll be bored here.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, I won't. We can talk like this, can't we? It won't be boring.
sound L58.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That's no way to spend summer break. You won't have any good memories of it at all if you just spend the whole thing cramped up in this room with me.
text @[Tomoya]
text But I like doing this... I have fun doing this.
sound L59.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text We're out of things to talk about, though.
sound L5A.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text All I do is sleep now...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's fine if we don't have anything to talk about.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm waiting and looking forward to things. Just the thought is enough to make me happy.
sound L5B.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text The thought of what?
text @[Tomoya]
text The day that I'll be able to walk with you while holding your hand.
sound L5C.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
sound L5D.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...Someone else...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Hm?
sound L5E.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I don't mind... if you hold hands and walk with someone else.
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't say that, you idiot. You'll make me mad.
sound L5F.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But what's the fun in having someone like me as your girlfriend?
sound L5G.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I feel bad for you, Tomoya-kun...
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you trying to dump me...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you telling me to go find someone else even though it's you I love...?
sound L5H.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I don't want to tell you that...
sound L5I.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I love you too, Tomoya-kun...
text @[Tomoya]
text Then don't say it, stupid...
sound L5J.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay...
text @[Tomoya]
text Never say that again...
sound L5K.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay... I understand.
sound L5L.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
sound L5M.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, what is it?
sound L5N.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Will you hold hands with me?
sound L5O.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I can't walk with you, but...
text @[Tomoya]
text Sure, that's fine.
text Nagisa raises her thin, white arm.
text I grab her palm firmly with both of my hands.
sound L5P.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text You must be sleepy. Wanna get some rest?
sound L5Q.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes, I think I will.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right, sounds good.
text Nagisa closes her eyes.
text A tear leaks out of the side of her eye.
text I hope that in dreams, at least... the two of us can walk together.
