text Second trimester begins.
text Everyone at school is busy studying, their sights dead set on what they'll be doing next spring.
text Even during breaks, they stay at their desks, eyes glued to reference books.
text Among them, I sit alone, thinking of Nagisa.
text She was only at school this year for a single month.
text But in that short time, she and I met, and we worked to see a single goal through...
text And by doing that, I was able to accomplish something I'd never been able to do in three whole years otherwise.
text I also fell in love with her during that month.
text At first I needed her, as someone who supported me.
text But now I just plain love her.
text I want to spend time with her.
text That's all.
