text We have a modest little party in Nagisa's room.
text It's the same lineup as always. Me, Nagisa, Sanae-san, the old man.
text Nineteen candles and a fir tree stand on the cake that Sanae-san made. It's a Christmas cake and a birthday cake all in one.
text Nagisa blows out the candles.
text She only eats one bite of the dessert, and we eat the rest.
text For my present to Nagisa, I give her a large Big Dango Family stuffed animal that I found after scouring countless toy stores.
text She's happy for a moment, but then she begins to feel sad. She says that there's nothing she can give me in return.
text But then, Sanae-san begins to sing the Big Dango Family song, and Nagisa smiles again as she sings along.
text Before I know it, we're all singing the song together.
text Nagisa seems to be having so much fun.
text Once we finish singing, Nagisa thanks everyone...
text And begins to cry.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG35E"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG35E.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound L6G.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Thank you so much Tomoya-kun, Dad, Mom...
sound L6H.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You did all this for someone like me...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK14T"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
